      "provider": {
        "name": "deepseek-tri",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "mode": "json_single"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "9router is an open-source AI gateway that connects coding assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot to free AI models from 40+ providers, eliminating API limits and costs. Its key technical insight is a smart routing layer with automatic fallback and real-time token optimization (RTK) that reduces token usage by 40%. Developers can use it to run AI coding tools without paid subscriptions, simply by configuring the gateway as a proxy endpoint.",
        "zh": "9router 是一个开源 AI 网关，专为 AI 编码助手设计。它能将 Claude Code、Cursor、Copilot 等工具连接到 40 多个免费 AI 模型提供商，彻底消除 API 限制和费用。其核心技术亮点是智能路由层：当某个模型不可用时自动回退到备用模型，并通过实时令牌优化（RTK）将令牌消耗降低 40%。开发者只需将 9router 配置为代理端点，即可免费使用原本需要付费订阅的 AI 编码功能。无论是个人实验还是团队协作，它都能大幅降低 AI 编码的门槛，让你专注于代码本身而非成本管理。",
        "es": "9router is an open-source AI gateway that connects coding assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot to free AI models from 40+ providers, eliminating API limits and costs. Its key technical insight is a smart routing layer with automatic fallback and real-time token optimization (RTK) that reduces token usage by 40%. Developers can use it to run AI coding tools without paid subscriptions, simply by configuring the gateway as a proxy endpoint.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "9router stands out for ai-agents, ai-gateway, and anthropic in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "9router is an open-source AI gateway that connects coding assistants like Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot to free AI models from 40+ providers, eliminating API limits and costs. Its key technical insight is a smart routing layer with automatic fallback and real-time token optimization (RTK) that reduces token usage by 40%. Developers can use it to run AI coding tools without paid subscriptions, simply by configuring the gateway as a proxy endpoint.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/decolua/9router for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
